{"video_id": "R8oiho_gKSo", "segment_index": 11, "start_seconds": 24.200000762939453, "end_seconds": 28.440000534057617, "text": "Well, then the shape on the ground would be a triangle pointing downwards.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "R8oiho_gKSo", "segment_index": 12, "start_seconds": 28.440000534057617, "end_seconds": 32.279998779296875, "text": "What's happening is that when the cardboard is high enough, you're no longer looking at", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
