{"video_id": "R8oiho_gKSo", "segment_index": 15, "start_seconds": 37.20000076293945, "end_seconds": 42.20000076293945, "text": "The cardboard has become the simplest kind of camera, what's known as a pinhole camera.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
